sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor CO as Petugas kepatuhan
    actor R as Reviewer
    actor S as Approver senior
    participant API as Backend API
    participant GW as Fabric Gateway
    participant CC as rupiah-controls

    CO->>API: POST /subjects/{subject_id}/restrictions
    API->>GW: Submit FreezeSubject(subject_id, reason_code)
    GW->>CC: FreezeSubject(subject_id, reason_code)
    CC->>CC: Set status terbatas dan alasan
    CC->>CC: Hapus reviewer dan referensi bukti lama
    CC-->>GW: Pembatasan tercatat
    GW-->>API: Commit
    API-->>CO: Hasil transaksi
    Note over GW,CC: Kebijakan endorsement berbasis state wajib dipenuhi.

    R->>API: POST /subjects/{subject_id}/restriction-release-requests<br/>authority_evidence_ref
    API->>GW: Submit RequestUnfreeze(subject_id, referensi SHA-256)
    GW->>CC: RequestUnfreeze(subject_id, referensi SHA-256)
    CC->>CC: Validasi peran reviewer dan status terbatas
    CC->>CC: Simpan identitas reviewer dan referensi baru
    CC-->>GW: Permintaan pelepasan tercatat
    GW-->>API: Commit
    API-->>R: Hasil transaksi

    S->>API: POST /subjects/{subject_id}/restriction-release-decisions
    API->>GW: Submit ApproveUnfreeze(subject_id)
    GW->>CC: ApproveUnfreeze(subject_id)
    CC->>CC: Validasi bukti dan identitas approver senior
    alt Bukti tersedia dan reviewer berbeda dari approver
        CC->>CC: Hapus status terbatas dan data pelepasan
        CC-->>GW: Pelepasan disetujui
        GW-->>API: Commit
        API-->>S: Pelepasan disetujui
    else Bukti tidak ada atau identitas sama
        CC-->>GW: Tolak, subjek tetap terbatas
        GW-->>API: Tidak ada state yang di-commit
        API-->>S: Pelepasan ditolak
    end
